      "source": "A convenience <a href=\"AsyncConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>AsyncConfigurer</code></a> that implements all methods\nso that the defaults are used. Provides a backward compatible alternative\nof implementing <a href=\"AsyncConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling.annotation\"><code>AsyncConfigurer</code></a> directly.",
